-# Experiment Eligibility after Day 28
-
-## Candidate eligible after PASS
-
-- E-A00–E-A04 on the four-class core view.
-- E-A05 only when frequency-feature prerequisites pass.
-- E-P00, E-P01, E-P02 if target calibration and test repetitions remain disjoint.
-- E-F03 only for the unknown-gesture abstention arm, not fatigue.
-
