-# Day 29 — Scope và gates
-
-## In-scope
-
-- GRABMyo train/validation EDA.
-- Hierarchy subject/day/session/repetition.
-- Signal quality mô tả.
-- Cross-day distribution shift.
-- Feature/experiment eligibility.
-- Readiness cho Day 30 harmonization.
-
-## Out-of-scope
-
-- Training/tuning.
-- Sealed-test signal access.
-- Pooled Mendeley + GRABMyo.
-- Fatigue diagnosis.
-- Motion Lab/Vinmec claims.
-- MFCV activation.
-
-## Final states
-
-```text
-GO_FOR_DAY30_HARMONIZATION
-BLOCKED_WITH_EVIDENCE
-```
diff --git a/day29_grabmyo_eda_data_quality_pack/docs/05-data/day29/01-input-contract.md b/day29_grabmyo_eda_data_quality_pack/docs/05-data/day29/01-input-contract.md
